      "prompt": "High quality 2D roguelike finely clustered pixel art sprite atlas, exactly FOUR columns and FIVE rows. Each row is its own animated elemental EXPLOSION RING. Column 1 compact burst from center, 2 expanding bold ring, 3 larger breaking open ring, 4 mostly gone with small edge sparks. Row 1 orange/gold flame curls (#FF8A1F), row 2 lemon yellow-white right-angle electricity (#FFF36B), row 3 teal/mint diamonds and tiny runes (#4FE3C1), row 4 pale ice blue fractured hexagonal ring (#9FDCFF), row 5 blue-violet/lavender shadow ring (#8A5CFF) with dark-purple inside. Keep interiors empty except opening flash. 4×5 perfectly spaced full circular bursts, regular square cells and air gaps, each row four complete frames, isolated real transparent background. Clear blocky edges, no antialiasing/glow/text, no red hues.",
