      "prompt": "2D finely clustered RPG pixel art upgrade charge animation asset atlas, exactly six evenly spaced columns and five rows. Each row is one element, in order fire gold/orange ember, electricity lemon white lightning, arcane turquoise diamond angular glyph, frost white blue angular snowflake, dark pale lilac crescent growing into almost full purple moon. Across six columns start as a pinhead at center, then 5 increasing build-up phases to full glowing pixel form occupying about two thirds of the cell. Every cell with one whole shape centered on real transparent alpha. No smooth gradients, grid lines, text, non-element colors, red or shadows. Distinct geometric themes, consistent centers for positioning on a separate staff tip.",
      "sha256": "857ec154e65851b5dcb3cd2b6c377ed3e258a6eb81fdf8aaf47c3419d500898b"
